-- statement:
--   Prove the exact original stopping/ruin/dividend-jump HJB pathwise upper budget f<=w(x)-k for the real limit f of full-T survivor terminal plus strict prefix cash and limit k of the actual predictable V minus negative marked source J. Preserve the precise original negative-jump counting measure and compensator, q-discount, finite activity BV controlled reserve, zero-time dividend atom and physical horizon endpoints. This is the nontrivial source-specific stopped Itô–Stieltjes inequality separated from the real convergence part BVB76.
-- source:
